OL,3,GNEWSASteps taken to protect historic
OL,4,Apottery site
OL,5,
OL,6,FSteps have been taken to stabilise and
OL,7,Fprotect the site of a historic pottery
OL,8,Ffactory after its owners had failed to
OL,9,Faddress concerns.
OL,11,FThe owners of the Falcon Works on
OL,12,FSturgess Street in Stoke,
OL,13,FStoke-on-Trent, had failed to repairs
OL,14,Fand maintenance to help prevent further
OL,15,Fdeterioration of buildings on the site,
OL,16,Fthe city council said.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
