OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSASteps taken to protect historic
OL,4,Apottery site
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Our heritage is one of the things that
OL,7,Fmakes this city unique," said
OL,8,Fcouncillor Finlay Gordon-McCusker.
OL,9,F"Once these buildings are lost, they
OL,10,Fare gone for good, which is why we're
OL,11,Fdetermined to act before more damage is
OL,12,Fdone."
OL,14,FThe authority said it would seek to
OL,15,Frecover its costs for the work. The BBC
OL,16,Fhas attempted to contact the site
OL,17,Fowner.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
